# Phase-6 table-bounds probe: simple_cluster physics run past the cooling-cube
# age limit. The non-CIE cooling cube's age grid ends at 1e7 yr (sweep 7, TBL-01),
# while stop_t defaults to 15 Myr, so a default-length run requests ages the table
# does not cover and get_filename clamps silently.
# This config exists to answer whether that clamp is reached in practice.
# Cheap-ish because phase1a_segFrac=0.1 makes segments geometric: the segment
# count is set by the log-range, not by stop_t.
mCloud    1e5
sfe    0.3
stop_t    15
